'Are you still watching?'"

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.816 size:88% position:44%
Yeah. I'm still watching
'cause I worked all day.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:17.817 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Leave me alone.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
